Package: libfprint-2-tod1-egis0576
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: EgisTec EH576 fingerprint driver as a libfprint TOD module
 A Touch OEM Driver (TOD) module for the EgisTec (LighTuning) EH576
 fingerprint sensor (USB ID 1c7a:0576), loaded at run time by the stock
 Ubuntu libfprint-2-2 and libfprint-2-tod1 packages. This package installs
 no library of its own and does not replace libfprint: it adds one driver
 module to the TOD drivers directory that libfprint-2-2 already reads, so
 the archive libfprint-2-2 and libfprint-2-tod1 packages are untouched and
 every other TOD driver (Goodix and others) keeps working unmodified.
 .
 See packaging/README.md in the source for the per-series build rule this
 package must be built under, and for install and upgrade notes.
